chatgpt-desktop-nix
===================

Packaging code: Copyright (c) 2026 stslex, MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

This repository packages, but does not redistribute, ChatGPT Desktop by
OpenAI. The application is fetched at build time from OpenAI's official signed
APT repository at https://persistent.oaistatic.com/codex-app-prod/linux/deb and
remains subject to OpenAI's terms. No OpenAI binary is committed to this
repository, attached to any release, or published to any binary cache.

The bundled Electron runtime inside that package is Copyright (c) Electron
contributors and Copyright (c) 2013-2020 GitHub Inc., MIT licensed; the
upstream copyright file is installed at
share/doc/chatgpt-desktop/upstream-copyright.

trust/openai-chatgpt-archive-keyring.gpg is OpenAI's public APT signing key,
extracted from the official package. See trust/KEY-PROVENANCE.md.

Prior art consulted while designing this package — no code was copied from any
of them; all implementation here is original:

  * https://github.com/ilysenko/codex-desktop-linux
  * https://github.com/numtide/llm-agents.nix
  * https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/551713
  * https://github.com/stslex/claude-desktop-nix (same author)
